@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Start;
:Note Vendor Number on Invoice Entry Form;
:Sort by Vendor or Amount?;
:v1: Sort by Vendor or Amount? ({By Vendor, By Amount}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = "By Vendor"])
:Sort Invoices by Vendor;
:Process Invoices (Vendor);
else ([v1 = "By Amount"])
:Sort Invoices by Amount;
:Process Invoices (Amount);
endif
:Note Time per 100 Invoices;
:Tick 'Invoice Entered' on Form;
-> After ticking the box, you can proceed with the process.;
:Place Invoice Batch in Urgent Outbox;
:Set Up Hourly Collection;
:End of Process;
stop
@enduml